.*
.* DSPSBSD: the menu of a subsystem description and a display for each
.* kind of entry it holds.
:PNLGRP.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE=ACTION.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=VALCL BASETYPE='CHAR 20'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=JOBCL BASETYPE='CHAR 13'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=JOBDCL BASETYPE='CHAR 18'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=IDCL BASETYPE='ZONED 2 0'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=SIZECL BASETYPE='CHAR 12'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=ACTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 8'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=SEQCL BASETYPE='ZONED 3 0'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=MAXCL BASETYPE='CHAR 6'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=PTYCL BASETYPE='CHAR 2'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=CMPCL BASETYPE='CHAR 26'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=POSCL BASETYPE='ZONED 3 0'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=TYPECL BASETYPE='CHAR 14'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=SBS CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=SBSLIB CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=STATUS CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=MAXJOBS CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=SGNDSPF CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=SGNLIB CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=SYSLIBLE CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=ASPGRP CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=WLGRP CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=OPT CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=POOLID CLASS=IDCL.
:VAR NAME=POOLSIZE CLASS=SIZECL.
:VAR NAME=ACTLVL CLASS=ACTCL.
:VAR NAME=AJEJOB CLASS=JOBCL.
:VAR NAME=AJEJOBD CLASS=JOBDCL.
:VAR NAME=AJELIB CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=WSNAME CLASS=TYPECL.
:VAR NAME=WSJOBD CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=WSJOBDL CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=WSMAX CLASS=MAXCL.
:VAR NAME=SEQ CLASS=SEQCL.
:VAR NAME=JOBQ CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=JOBQLIB CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=MAXACT CLASS=MAXCL.
:VAR NAME=M1 CLASS=PTYCL.
:VAR NAME=M2 CLASS=PTYCL.
:VAR NAME=M3 CLASS=PTYCL.
:VAR NAME=M4 CLASS=PTYCL.
:VAR NAME=M5 CLASS=PTYCL.
:VAR NAME=M6 CLASS=PTYCL.
:VAR NAME=M7 CLASS=PTYCL.
:VAR NAME=M8 CLASS=PTYCL.
:VAR NAME=M9 CLASS=PTYCL.
:VAR NAME=RTSEQ CLASS=SEQCL.
:VAR NAME=PGM CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=PGMLIB CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=CMPVAL CLASS=CMPCL.
:VAR NAME=STARTPOS CLASS=POSCL.
:VAR NAME=DEV CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=MODE CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=CMNJOBD CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=PJEPGM CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=PJELIB CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=PJEUSER CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=PJEJOB CLASS=NAMECL.
:LISTDEF NAME=POOLS VARS='POOLID POOLSIZE ACTLVL'.
:LISTDEF NAME=AJES VARS='AJEJOB AJEJOBD AJELIB'.
:LISTDEF NAME=WSES VARS='OPT WSNAME WSJOBD WSJOBDL WSMAX'.
:LISTDEF NAME=JOBQES VARS='SEQ JOBQ JOBQLIB MAXACT M1 M2 M3 M4 M5 M6 M7 M8 M9'.
:LISTDEF NAME=RTGES VARS='OPT RTSEQ PGM PGMLIB CMPVAL STARTPOS'.
:LISTDEF NAME=CMNES VARS='DEV MODE CMNJOBD MAXACT'.
:LISTDEF NAME=PJES VARS='PJEPGM PJELIB PJEUSER PJEJOB'.
:KEYL NAME=MENUKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F4 ACTION='RETURN 4'.F4=Prompt
:KEYI KEY=F9 ACTION=RETRIEVE.F9=Retrieve
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:EKEYL.
:KEYL NAME=DSPKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:EKEYL.
:KEYL NAME=DTLKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F9 ACTION='RETURN 9'.F9=Display all detailed descriptions
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=DSPSBSD KEYL=MENUKEYS HELP=DSPSBSD ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Display Subsystem Description
:DATA DEPTH=3 COMPACT.
:DATAI VAR=SBS USAGE=OUTPUT.Subsystem description
:DATAIX VAR=SBSLIB USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAIXT.Library
:DATAI VAR=STATUS USAGE=OUTPUT.Status
:EDATA.
:MENU DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES.Select one of the following:
:MENUI OPTION=1 ACTION='RETURN 101'.Operational attributes
:MENUI OPTION=2 ACTION='RETURN 102'.Pool definitions
:MENUI OPTION=3 ACTION='RETURN 103'.Autostart job entries
:MENUI OPTION=4 ACTION='RETURN 104'.Work station name entries
:MENUI OPTION=5 ACTION='RETURN 105'.Work station type entries
:MENUI OPTION=6 ACTION='RETURN 106'.Job queue entries
:MENUI OPTION=7 ACTION='RETURN 107'.Routing entries
:MENUI OPTION=8 ACTION='RETURN 108'.Communications entries
:MENUI OPTION=9 ACTION='RETURN 109'.Remote location name entries
:MENUI OPTION=10 ACTION='RETURN 110'.Prestart job entries
:MENUI OPTION=20 ACTION='RETURN 120'.Every entry, one display after another
:MENUI OPTION=21 ACTION='RETURN 121'.Work with the subsystem's jobs
:EMENU.
:CMDLINE SIZE=LONG.
:EPANEL.
.* The heading every entry display shares.
:PANEL NAME=OPRATR KEYL=DSPKEYS HELP=DSPSBSD ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Display Operational Attributes
:DATA DEPTH=2 COMPACT.
:DATAI VAR=SBS USAGE=OUTPUT.Subsystem description
:DATAIX VAR=STATUS USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAIXT.Status
:EDATA.
:DATA DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES.
:DATAI VAR=SBS USAGE=OUTPUT.Subsystem description
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI VAR=SBSLIB USAGE=OUTPUT.Library
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI VAR=MAXJOBS USAGE=OUTPUT.Maximum jobs in subsystem
:DATAI VAR=SGNDSPF USAGE=OUTPUT.Sign-on display file
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI VAR=SGNLIB USAGE=OUTPUT.Library
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI VAR=SYSLIBLE USAGE=OUTPUT.System library list entry
:DATAI VAR=ASPGRP USAGE=OUTPUT.Auxiliary storage pool group
:DATAI VAR=WLGRP USAGE=OUTPUT.Workload group
:EDATA.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=POOLS KEYL=DSPKEYS HELP=DSPSBSD ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Display Pool Definitions
:DATA DEPTH=2 COMPACT.
:DATAI VAR=SBS USAGE=OUTPUT.Subsystem description
:DATAIX VAR=STATUS USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAIXT.Status
:EDATA.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=POOLS.(No pool definitions)
:LISTCOL VAR=POOLID USAGE=OUTPUT.Pool ID
:LISTCOL VAR=POOLSIZE USAGE=OUTPUT.Storage Size (M)
:LISTCOL VAR=ACTLVL USAGE=OUTPUT.Activity Level
:ELIST.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=AJES KEYL=DSPKEYS HELP=DSPSBSD ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Display Autostart Job Entries
:DATA DEPTH=2 COMPACT.
:DATAI VAR=SBS USAGE=OUTPUT.Subsystem description
:DATAIX VAR=STATUS USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAIXT.Status
:EDATA.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=AJES.(No autostart job entries)
:LISTCOL VAR=AJEJOB USAGE=OUTPUT.Job
:LISTCOL VAR=AJEJOBD USAGE=OUTPUT.Job Description
:LISTCOL VAR=AJELIB USAGE=OUTPUT.Library
:ELIST.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=WSNES KEYL=DTLKEYS HELP=DSPSBSD ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM BOTSEP=NONE.Display Work Station Name Entries
:DATA DEPTH=2 COMPACT.
:DATAI VAR=SBS USAGE=OUTPUT.Subsystem description
:DATAIX VAR=STATUS USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAIXT.Status
:EDATA.
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=WSES.(No work station name entries)
:LISTACT OPTION=5 ENTER='RETURN 5'.5=Display work station name details
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=WSNAME USAGE=OUTPUT.Name
:LISTCOL VAR=WSJOBD USAGE=OUTPUT.Job Description
:LISTCOL VAR=WSJOBDL USAGE=OUTPUT.Library
:LISTCOL VAR=WSMAX USAGE=OUTPUT.Max Active
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=WSTES KEYL=DTLKEYS HELP=DSPSBSD ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM BOTSEP=NONE.Display Work Station Type Entries
:DATA DEPTH=2 COMPACT.
:DATAI VAR=SBS USAGE=OUTPUT.Subsystem description
:DATAIX VAR=STATUS USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAIXT.Status
:EDATA.
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=WSES.(No work station type entries)
:LISTACT OPTION=5 ENTER='RETURN 5'.5=Display work station type details
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=WSNAME USAGE=OUTPUT.Type
:LISTCOL VAR=WSJOBD USAGE=OUTPUT.Job Description
:LISTCOL VAR=WSJOBDL USAGE=OUTPUT.Library
:LISTCOL VAR=WSMAX USAGE=OUTPUT.Max Active
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=JOBQES KEYL=DSPKEYS HELP=DSPSBSD ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Display Job Queue Entries
:DATA DEPTH=2 COMPACT.
:DATAI VAR=SBS USAGE=OUTPUT.Subsystem description
:DATAIX VAR=STATUS USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAIXT.Status
:EDATA.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=JOBQES.(No job queue entries)
:LISTCOL VAR=SEQ USAGE=OUTPUT.Seq Nbr
:LISTCOL VAR=JOBQ USAGE=OUTPUT.Job Queue
:LISTCOL VAR=JOBQLIB USAGE=OUTPUT.Library
:LISTCOL VAR=MAXACT USAGE=OUTPUT.Max Active
:LISTGRP.---------Max by Priority----------
:LISTCOL VAR=M1 USAGE=OUTPUT.1
:LISTCOL VAR=M2 USAGE=OUTPUT.2
:LISTCOL VAR=M3 USAGE=OUTPUT.3
:LISTCOL VAR=M4 USAGE=OUTPUT.4
:LISTCOL VAR=M5 USAGE=OUTPUT.5
:LISTCOL VAR=M6 USAGE=OUTPUT.6
:LISTCOL VAR=M7 USAGE=OUTPUT.7
:LISTCOL VAR=M8 USAGE=OUTPUT.8
:LISTCOL VAR=M9 USAGE=OUTPUT.9
:ELISTGRP.
:ELIST.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=RTGES KEYL=DTLKEYS HELP=DSPSBSD ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM BOTSEP=NONE.Display Routing Entries
:DATA DEPTH=2 COMPACT.
:DATAI VAR=SBS USAGE=OUTPUT.Subsystem description
:DATAIX VAR=STATUS USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAIXT.Status
:EDATA.
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=RTGES.(No routing entries)
:LISTACT OPTION=5 ENTER='RETURN 5'.5=Display details
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=RTSEQ USAGE=OUTPUT.Seq Nbr
:LISTCOL VAR=PGM USAGE=OUTPUT.Program
:LISTCOL VAR=PGMLIB USAGE=OUTPUT.Library
:LISTCOL VAR=CMPVAL USAGE=OUTPUT.Compare Value
:LISTCOL VAR=STARTPOS USAGE=OUTPUT.Start Pos
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=CMNES KEYL=DSPKEYS HELP=DSPSBSD ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Display Communications Entries
:DATA DEPTH=2 COMPACT.
:DATAI VAR=SBS USAGE=OUTPUT.Subsystem description
:DATAIX VAR=STATUS USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAIXT.Status
:EDATA.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=CMNES.(No communications entries)
:LISTCOL VAR=DEV USAGE=OUTPUT.Device
:LISTCOL VAR=MODE USAGE=OUTPUT.Mode
:LISTCOL VAR=CMNJOBD USAGE=OUTPUT.Job Description
:LISTCOL VAR=MAXACT USAGE=OUTPUT.Max Active
:ELIST.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=PJES KEYL=DSPKEYS HELP=DSPSBSD ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Display Prestart Job Entries
:DATA DEPTH=2 COMPACT.
:DATAI VAR=SBS USAGE=OUTPUT.Subsystem description
:DATAIX VAR=STATUS USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAIXT.Status
:EDATA.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=PJES.(No prestart job entries)
:LISTCOL VAR=PJEPGM USAGE=OUTPUT.Program
:LISTCOL VAR=PJELIB USAGE=OUTPUT.Library
:LISTCOL VAR=PJEUSER USAGE=OUTPUT.User Profile
:LISTCOL VAR=PJEJOB USAGE=OUTPUT.Job
:ELIST.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=DSPSBSD.Display Subsystem Description - Help
:P.What a subsystem description holds: its attributes, its storage
pools and the entries that decide which jobs it starts and how it
routes them. Type an option number and press Enter.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
